AQT5UmF5gKuCXRrtJfbeDot6J4Ts6tLCqTswNAmOh_Q7AQ&oe=6B0DCAF7"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SbZv_GiU1qwQ7kNvwGl0zRw&_nc_oc=AdoB-sx8wMkJjnBvnIX4F-t6hr4oCxK3wwAF-Gzu9DpGrWgrZo68HvlCespz5zk1Qg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQZRlxWKs2PXkvw75e69ACrBp6yfKMigEjGNafZZVpKBw&oe=6B0DBA07"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U6RGfPLpbzAQ7kNvwHu5Qks&_nc_oc=AdqOV3U9bXPE0oiYXID2JmrTYyz1otvaEE9NLIn3tTmodYwYOMxga-nxaSRL-aNHNPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSgM0SqR8gUsvNFFCoICq5jcuReYjIOk4UcQt3p9n83Xw&oe=6B0DA3D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DRrFtfF1xJ8Q7kNvwE2F4si&_nc_oc=AdowmIHboSd0SlnWMmDC0mDEZ4QHXHOcUd66WcNIYHQYZEkSCi-mJZ7UoqYXyejClLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSa7Ap7IkYi7XEK8_IyfufvCpo8vRToDopsNVEuJv0VNA&oe=6B0D9ACF"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c_qbGWG_rScQ7kNvwEOvLZM&_nc_oc=AdoIAV6k3qYe3eqyeMszhKY-P3uediqTX-MBrrIUFW0B31-BKmtWdCYhyRafAQn_e5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRHP0X44YOaIPhFpFyAFy5iivts7MQFU2tCh3Qr3jCUeg&oe=6B0DA435"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xj8T100mIQoQ7kNvwEwzTRW&_nc_oc=AdrMR4I9jBZlEAsK_zVN8LaJ0OaODxMOiNrbKWjeu0X-XF40N1drmkOXdlnMDy_vOpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRF7BCjbgTLc7dleKP1yxWzu6mjq2q_nKHqg2o7le1Fyw&oe=6B0D9D85"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca